{"id":"prepositions-0068","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 68","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Millions suffer ___ hay fever every summer.","hint":"suffer ___ sth","explanation":"suffer FROM an illness/problem."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":["of","from","by","with"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She suffered ___ migraines for years before the surgery.","hint":"suffer ___ an illness","explanation":"\u0027Suffer from\u0027 an illness or condition."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Critics attacked the film ___ its slow pace.","hint":"criticise sth ___ sth","explanation":"criticise/criticize something FOR a reason."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":["for","of","to","with"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s responsible ___ training the new staff.","hint":"responsible ___ doing something","explanation":"\u0027Responsible for\u0027 = in charge of."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Were you aware ___ the change of plan?","hint":"aware ___ sth","explanation":"aware OF something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":["with","for","as","by"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I mistook him ___ one of the technicians \u2014 he was actually the new director.","hint":"mistake A ___ B","explanation":"\u0027Mistake somebody for somebody else\u0027 = wrongly believe they are that person."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Is there any excuse ___ being so rude?","hint":"excuse ___ sth","explanation":"an excuse FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The press joked ___ the politician\u0027s hat.","hint":"joke ___ sth","explanation":"